  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/533835/diamond-spheres-hustle-bustle?src=newest%3Faffiliate_id%3D3028400\">Diamond Spheres: Hustle &amp; Bustle</a></sup></p>\n<p>When you adopt the confident subtlety approach, you also gain a +2 bonus to Sleight of Hand checks made to conceal an object or to lift or plant an item on a creature, increasing by +1 per 4 associated ranks you possess.</p>\n<p>Additionally, whenever you lift an item from a creature, you can plant an item on the creature or another creature within your natural reach as a free action (requiring a skill check as normal). If you outwit the creature as a cost, you can roll twice and take the highest result when doing so.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/subterfuge#toc13\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
